      "funding_type": "grant",
      "typical_award_size": "Federal FY 2026 allocations used July 1, 2026 to June 30, 2027: CDBG $3,116,754, HOME $1,137,340, ESG $278,809. HOME program budget including carryover: affordable rental rehabilitation loans and grants $6,000,000, new construction development loans and grants $5,318,870, tenant-based rental assistance $300,000, administration $571,271, CHDO reserve $290,734 (County set-aside is 25%, above the 15% minimum). CDBG: $1,071,589 for unincorporated public facilities, $1,542,523 to the eight participating cities, $135,000 public services, $300,000 Sheriff programs. HOME match is met from $27,953,832 of banked match (June 30, 2025).",
      "per_unit_cap": "HUD HOME per-unit subsidy limits.",
